<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.1.2">
<l>caḻakku nākkoṭu puṉkavi coṉṉēṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">caṅku cakkara mēntukai yaṉē</l>
<l>piḻaippa rākilun tammaṭi yārcol</l>
<l rend="indent">poṟuppa tuperi yōrkaṭa ṉaṉṟē</l>
<l>viḻikkuṅ kaṇṇilēṉ niṉkaṇmaṟ ṟallāl</l>
<l rend="indent">vēṟo ruvarō ṭeṉmaṉam paṟṟā</l>
<l>tuḻaikkōr puḷḷimi kaiyaṉṟu kaṇṭāy</l>
<l rend="indent">ūḻi yēḻula kuṇṭumiḻn tāṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>One who bears the conch and discus in [your] hands!</l>
<l rend="indent">With a faulty tongue I have spoken [this] lowly poem.</l>
<l>Is it not the duty of the great to endure,</l>
<l rend="indent">the words of their servants, even if they do wrong?</l>
<l>I do not have eyes that look except eyes for you,</l>
<l rend="indent">my mind does not grasp any other.</l>
<l>One who ate and spit out the seven worlds long ago,</l>
<l rend="indent">a spot on a deer is not a defect, you see.</l>


      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
